      "id": "claim_4b3c69dfab314a1b960e51dd93d3ee45",
      "statement": "AdminSettings is the deployment-wide singleton Durable Object that owns the authoritative AdminConfig and mirrors it to the reserved KV key .adminConfig so hot paths resolve it with one cheap KV get via readAdminConfig(env); every config setter writes both, with the read/modify/write serialized on a promise tail to prevent lost updates, and site-logo changes serialized on a separate tail.",
      "evidence": [
        {
