      "statement": "The bundled format-blueprint install is coalesced onto one in-flight run and stamped complete only once the whole manifest is live so a partial install retries, and bundled formats are promoted once ever — re-deriving the promoted list from the manifest on every startup would undo an admin's later removal.",
