      "statement": "Auto-provisioning (ambient) gatekeepers get a per-vendor three-state mode from AdminConfig.ambientGatekeeperModes — disabled (no account provisioned, existing dormant), optional (user opt-in from Connectors; the default), enabled (auto-provisioned for every user, forced, hidden from Connectors) — with provisioning-policy.ts the single chokepoint that UserDurableObject consults when provisioning, listing, and surfacing ambient accounts.",
