      "id": "claim_d2d68922535f41ba98d46ef4bfc224d4",
      "statement": "The backend's optional env vars include ADMINS (admin list), CF_ACCESS_AUD/CF_ACCESS_ISS (Cloudflare Access SSO, which disables password and gatekeeper login paths), AUTH_GATEKEEPERS (comma-separated sign-in vendor allowlist, each vendor also required to advertise providesAuth), DISABLE_PASSWORD_AUTH (only effective when at least one auth gatekeeper is allowlisted, to avoid lockout), ENABLE_CLOUDFLARE_LIMITS, DAILY_LLM_CALL_LIMIT, MINIMUM_CLOUDFLARE_BALANCE, PUBLIC_BASE_URL, DEV, and FLAGS.",
